      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://theoregoncoastguide.com/siletz-oregon/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Siletz hosts the annual Nesika Illahee Pow Wow every August near the Siletz Reservation.",
